msgstr "⟪k:0⟫누구……, ⟪k:1⟫안 계시나요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E3B8080E_64F4_494C_8748_E633AB9B7B86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d6fe9a0a389518c3c4af51337aa876185de3ae99b2f82868047e36e133ecbf8
