msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would, indeed, have no need of extravagant dresses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after all, she could not "
"see what she was wearing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫화사한 드레스가 필요하지 않을 만도 했습니다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫소녀에게는 드레스도 보이지 않았으니까"
"요."

