msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is correct; I am blind...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But who ever decided that reality is only that which "
"can be seen?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫네, ⟪k:1⟫저는 장님이에요…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫하지만 눈에 보이는 것만이 진실임을 ⟪k:4⟫규정한 이는 없어"
"요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3520CD30_9B22_4B24_A869_88E7B38DC357
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e5e3e297b0b1cd3aad30abc0c5f474c0350a1d67746e1a71cf82a9e0218c166
