msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know not what appearance I have."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 지금 ⟪k:1⟫어떤 모습을 하고 있는지 ⟪k:2⟫저는 몰라요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_590045A2_5DA3_4579_A391_E1875D295C2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 369f7fe221fdb8809f6b4f3acb99a760dbf896bca595e114d6df75c73bc31502
